No, not really. However, I just discovered nethack.alt.org, and I must 
say it is wonderful to be able to play on a multi-user system again. 
Since I like playing with tiles, I installed my rather long .nethackrc 
definition to be able to use my Nethack "Tile" Font. It works just great 
guys! (However I can imagine others having trouble watching my games.) 
Since the original 16x16 font requires a hefty 1280 pixels wide window, 
I decided to make a tile-like 12x12 font as well (for a more discreet 
window during work-breaks). Now I have uploaded it to my Nethack Tile 
Font page for all to enjoy:

